    <item>
      <title>Perplexity Comet：AI重塑浏览器，从“搜索”到“对话代理”的范式跃迁</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/perplexity-cometai-20250728111005358-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 28 Jul 2025 11:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
